  "body": "If you've been looking for a private, North facing home that offers space for the family, flow, room to relax and a superb coastal location, this one deserves your attention.\r\nOffering three generous double bedrooms and two separate living areas, there's plenty of room for everyone. \r\nUpstairs is a real parents' retreat, a spacious bedroom complemented by a walk-in wardrobe, full bathroom, living area and private deck where you can enjoy a quiet morning coffee and a glimpse of the sea.\r\nDownstairs, the welcoming living room features both a wood-burning fireplace and heat pump, ensuring year-round comfort and a cosy place to unwind. The living areas connect effortlessly to the beautiful garden, creating that sought-after indoor-outdoor flow that's perfect for entertaining, family time or simply enjoying the outdoors.\r\nA large double internal access garage adds practicality and convenience, while the location puts beaches, local shops and everything this popular coastal community has to offer within easy reach.\r\nA home with space to spread out, somewhere to unwind and a lifestyle to love.",
